{"seq":2,"slug":"flame-graph-analysis","title":"火焰图解读与实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling/flame-graph-analysis","wordCount":834,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"火焰图解读与实战\">火焰图解读与实战</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>火焰图（Flame Graph）是由 Brendan Gregg 于 2011 年发明的性能数据可视化技术。它将采样得到的调用栈数据转化为一张直观的 SVG 图像，让开发者一眼就能识别出程序中的性能热点。火焰图已经成为性能分析领域的事实标准可视化方式，被各大 profiling 工具和平台广泛采用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"火焰图的视觉语义\">火焰图的视觉语义</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph READING[&quot;火焰图解读规则&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        R1[&quot;X 轴: 字母排序, 不是时间轴&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;Y 轴: 调用栈深度, 底部是入口&quot;]&#10;        R3[&quot;宽度: 函数占总采样的比例&quot;]&#10;        R4[&quot;颜色: 随机暖色, 无特殊含义&quot;]&#10;        R5[&quot;平顶: 函数自身消耗 CPU 的位置&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph READING[\"火焰图解读规则\"]\n        direction TB\n        R1[\"X 轴: 字母排序, 不是时间轴\"]\n        R2[\"Y 轴: 调用栈深度, 底部是入口\"]\n        R3[\"宽度: 函数占总采样的比例\"]\n        R4[\"颜色: 随机暖色, 无特殊含义\"]\n        R5[\"平顶: 函数自身消耗 CPU 的位置\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视觉元素</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>排查要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宽条块</td>\n<td>占比大的函数（含子调用）</td>\n<td>优化候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平顶（flat top）</td>\n<td>自身执行消耗 CPU</td>\n<td>直接优化目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深而窄的塔</td>\n<td>调用层次深但各层耗时少</td>\n<td>通常不是问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宽而浅的块</td>\n<td>某个函数被大量调用</td>\n<td>减少调用次数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"火焰图类型\">火焰图类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU 火焰图</td>\n<td>CPU 周期</td>\n<td>找 CPU 热点</td>\n<td>perf record -F 99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Off-CPU 火焰图</td>\n<td>阻塞时间</td>\n<td>找等待瓶颈</td>\n<td>eBPF/offcputime</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存火焰图</td>\n<td>分配字节数</td>\n<td>找分配热点</td>\n<td>pprof alloc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差分火焰图</td>\n<td>两版本差异</td>\n<td>定位性能回归</td>\n<td>difffolded.pl</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"从数据到火焰图的完整流程\">从数据到火焰图的完整流程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 步骤 1: 数据采集&#10;perf record -F 99 -a -g -- sleep 30&#10;&#10;# 步骤 2: 导出堆栈&#10;perf script &gt; out.perf&#10;&#10;# 步骤 3: 堆栈折叠（多行 → 单行）&#10;./stackcollapse-perf.pl out.perf &gt; folded.txt&#10;# 输出格式: 调用链;函数A;函数B;函数C 采样数&#10;# 示例: main;handleRequest;queryDB;execute 342&#10;&#10;# 步骤 4: 生成火焰图 SVG&#10;./flamegraph.pl folded.txt &gt; flamegraph.svg&#10;&#10;# 完整单行命令&#10;perf script | ./stackcollapse-perf.pl | ./flamegraph.pl &gt; cpu.svg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 1: 数据采集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 99</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 2: 导出堆栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> out.perf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 3: 堆栈折叠（多行 → 单行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./stackcollapse-perf.pl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> out.perf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> folded.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出格式: 调用链;函数A;函数B;函数C 采样数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 示例: main;handleRequest;queryDB;execute 342</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 4: 生成火焰图 SVG</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./flamegraph.pl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> folded.txt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flamegraph.svg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 完整单行命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ./stackcollapse-perf.pl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ./flamegraph.pl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cpu.svg</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"案例一-识别-cpu-热点\">案例一：识别 CPU 热点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Go 服务的 CPU 火焰图&#10;go tool pprof -http=:8080 &#39;http://service:6060/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30&#39;&#10;# 浏览器打开 → View → Flame Graph&#10;&#10;# 解读结果&#10;# 如果看到 encoding/json.Unmarshal 占 40% 宽度&#10;# → JSON 反序列化是瓶颈&#10;# 优化方向：使用 sonic/jsoniter 替代标准库，或减少反序列化次数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Go 服务的 CPU 火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -http=:8080</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'http://service:6060/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 浏览器打开 → View → Flame Graph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 解读结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果看到 encoding/json.Unmarshal 占 40% 宽度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → JSON 反序列化是瓶颈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 优化方向：使用 sonic/jsoniter 替代标准库，或减少反序列化次数</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"案例二-off-cpu-火焰图定位-io-阻塞\">案例二：Off-CPU 火焰图定位 IO 阻塞</h3><p>Off-CPU 火焰图显示线程不在 CPU 上执行时（阻塞等待）的调用栈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 bcc 工具采集 Off-CPU 数据&#10;# (需要 root 权限和内核支持 eBPF)&#10;/usr/share/bcc/tools/offcputime -df -p $(pidof myapp) 30 &gt; offcpu.stacks&#10;&#10;# 生成 Off-CPU 火焰图（使用蓝色方案区分）&#10;./flamegraph.pl --color=io --title=&quot;Off-CPU Flame Graph&quot; offcpu.stacks &gt; offcpu.svg&#10;&#10;# 解读：&#10;# 如果看到 futex_wait → pthread_mutex_lock 占大比例&#10;# → 锁竞争是瓶颈&#10;# 如果看到 io_schedule → ext4_file_read&#10;# → 磁盘 IO 是瓶颈\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 bcc 工具采集 Off-CPU 数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># (需要 root 权限和内核支持 eBPF)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/usr/share/bcc/tools/offcputime</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -df</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pidof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> offcpu.stacks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成 Off-CPU 火焰图（使用蓝色方案区分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./flamegraph.pl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --color=io</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --title=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Off-CPU Flame Graph\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> offcpu.stacks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> offcpu.svg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 解读：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果看到 futex_wait → pthread_mutex_lock 占大比例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → 锁竞争是瓶颈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果看到 io_schedule → ext4_file_read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → 磁盘 IO 是瓶颈</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"案例三-差分火焰图定位性能回归\">案例三：差分火焰图定位性能回归</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 采集基准版本的 profile&#10;git checkout v2.3.0&#10;make build &amp;&amp; perf record -F 99 -g -- ./bin/app --benchmark&#10;perf script | ./stackcollapse-perf.pl &gt; baseline.folded&#10;&#10;# 采集当前版本&#10;git checkout main&#10;make build &amp;&amp; perf record -F 99 -g -- ./bin/app --benchmark&#10;perf script | ./stackcollapse-perf.pl &gt; current.folded&#10;&#10;# 生成差分火焰图&#10;./difffolded.pl baseline.folded current.folded | ./flamegraph.pl &gt; diff.svg&#10;&#10;# 解读差分火焰图：&#10;# 红色 → 新版本中增加的采样（性能变差的部分）&#10;# 蓝色 → 新版本中减少的采样（性能变好的部分）&#10;# 宽红色块 → 这就是性能回归的来源\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 采集基准版本的 profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v2.3.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 99</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./bin/app</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --benchmark</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ./stackcollapse-perf.pl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> baseline.folded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 采集当前版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 99</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./bin/app</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --benchmark</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ./stackcollapse-perf.pl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> current.folded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成差分火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./difffolded.pl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> baseline.folded</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> current.folded</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ./flamegraph.pl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff.svg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 解读差分火焰图：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 红色 → 新版本中增加的采样（性能变差的部分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 蓝色 → 新版本中减少的采样（性能变好的部分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 宽红色块 → 这就是性能回归的来源</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"案例四-内存分配火焰图\">案例四：内存分配火焰图</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Go: 内存分配火焰图&#10;go tool pprof -http=:8080 &#39;http://service:6060/debug/pprof/allocs?seconds=30&#39;&#10;&#10;# Java: 使用 async-profiler&#10;./asprof -e alloc -d 30 --alloc 512k -f alloc.html $(pidof java)&#10;# --alloc 512k: 只采集 &gt;= 512KB 的分配（过滤小对象噪音）&#10;&#10;# 解读：&#10;# 宽的平顶块 = 大量内存分配的代码位置&#10;# 如果看到 []byte 分配在某个 JSON 序列化路径&#10;# → 考虑对象池复用或减少中间分配\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Go: 内存分配火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -http=:8080</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'http://service:6060/debug/pprof/allocs?seconds=30'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Java: 使用 async-profiler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./asprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alloc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --alloc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 512k</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alloc.html</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pidof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> java</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># --alloc 512k: 只采集 >= 512KB 的分配（过滤小对象噪音）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 解读：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 宽的平顶块 = 大量内存分配的代码位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果看到 []byte 分配在某个 JSON 序列化路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → 考虑对象池复用或减少中间分配</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"火焰图的交互式分析\">火焰图的交互式分析</h3><p>现代火焰图工具支持交互式操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"操作指南（SVG 火焰图）：&#10;- 点击某个函数 → 放大该子树，只看该函数及其调用的内容&#10;- 搜索（Ctrl+F 或输入框）→ 高亮匹配的函数，显示占比&#10;- 重置视图 → 点击底部的根节点&#10;- 鼠标悬停 → 显示函数名、采样数、占比&#10;&#10;技巧：&#10;- 搜索 &quot;lock&quot; 或 &quot;mutex&quot; → 快速定位锁竞争&#10;- 搜索 &quot;gc&quot; 或 &quot;sweep&quot; → 快速定位 GC 压力&#10;- 搜索 &quot;alloc&quot; 或 &quot;malloc&quot; → 快速定位内存分配热点&#10;- 搜索 &quot;io&quot; 或 &quot;read&quot; 或 &quot;write&quot; → 快速定位 IO 操作\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>操作指南（SVG 火焰图）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 点击某个函数 → 放大该子树，只看该函数及其调用的内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 搜索（Ctrl+F 或输入框）→ 高亮匹配的函数，显示占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 重置视图 → 点击底部的根节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 鼠标悬停 → 显示函数名、采样数、占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>技巧：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 搜索 \"lock\" 或 \"mutex\" → 快速定位锁竞争</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 搜索 \"gc\" 或 \"sweep\" → 快速定位 GC 压力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 搜索 \"alloc\" 或 \"malloc\" → 快速定位内存分配热点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 搜索 \"io\" 或 \"read\" 或 \"write\" → 快速定位 IO 操作</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"火焰图采集清单\">火焰图采集清单</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样频率</td>\n<td>99Hz（生产）或 997Hz（测试）</td>\n<td>避免与时钟对齐产生偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样时长</td>\n<td>≥ 30s（建议 60s）</td>\n<td>保证统计显著性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号信息</td>\n<td>确保有 debug symbols</td>\n<td>否则只看到地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载代表性</td>\n<td>在真实负载下采集</td>\n<td>空闲时采集无意义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多次采集</td>\n<td>至少 2-3 次对比</td>\n<td>排除偶发波动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"常见误读纠正\">常见误读纠正</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误理解</th>\n<th>正确理解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;X轴是时间轴&quot;</td>\n<td>X轴是字母排序，无时间含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;高的函数更慢&quot;</td>\n<td>高度只是调用深度，不代表耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;所有宽块都要优化&quot;</td>\n<td>只优化平顶（self time 高）的块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;颜色深浅代表严重程度&quot;</td>\n<td>默认颜色是随机的，无含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;火焰图显示所有问题&quot;</td>\n<td>只显示被采样到的路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"优化效果量化\">优化效果量化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 优化前后对比框架&#10;optimization_report = {&#10;    &quot;目标函数&quot;: &quot;encoding/json.Unmarshal&quot;,&#10;    &quot;优化前占比&quot;: &quot;38.5%&quot;,&#10;    &quot;优化方案&quot;: &quot;替换为 sonic.Unmarshal&quot;,&#10;    &quot;优化后占比&quot;: &quot;8.2%&quot;,&#10;    &quot;QPS 提升&quot;: &quot;从 5000 → 8500 (+70%)&quot;,&#10;    &quot;P99 延迟&quot;: &quot;从 45ms → 18ms (-60%)&quot;,&#10;    &quot;验证方法&quot;: &quot;差分火焰图确认红色块消失&quot;,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 优化前后对比框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimization_report </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"目标函数\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"encoding/json.Unmarshal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"优化前占比\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"38.5%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"优化方案\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"替换为 sonic.Unmarshal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"优化后占比\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8.2%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"QPS 提升\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"从 5000 → 8500 (+70%)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"P99 延迟\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"从 45ms → 18ms (-60%)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"验证方法\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"差分火焰图确认红色块消失\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"火焰图生成工具\">火焰图生成工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>输入来源</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FlameGraph (Brendan Gregg)</td>\n<td>perf, DTrace, systemtap</td>\n<td>原版 Perl 脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>speedscope</td>\n<td>多种 profile 格式</td>\n<td>Web 交互式查看器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pprof (Go)</td>\n<td>Go runtime profile</td>\n<td>内置火焰图视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>async-profiler</td>\n<td>JVM</td>\n<td>HTML 交互式输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>py-spy</td>\n<td>Python 进程</td>\n<td>直接生成 SVG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grafana Pyroscope</td>\n<td>持续 profiling 数据</td>\n<td>时间范围选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"平台集成\">平台集成</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph COLLECT[&quot;采集层&quot;]&#10;        P1[&quot;perf/eBPF&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;pprof&quot;]&#10;        P3[&quot;async-profiler&quot;]&#10;        P4[&quot;py-spy&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph STORE[&quot;存储层&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;Pyroscope&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;Parca&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph VIEW[&quot;展示层&quot;]&#10;        V1[&quot;Grafana&quot;]&#10;        V2[&quot;speedscope&quot;]&#10;        V3[&quot;pprof Web UI&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    COLLECT --&gt; STORE&#10;    STORE --&gt; VIEW\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph COLLECT[\"采集层\"]\n        P1[\"perf/eBPF\"]\n        P2[\"pprof\"]\n        P3[\"async-profiler\"]\n        P4[\"py-spy\"]\n    end\n    subgraph STORE[\"存储层\"]\n        S1[\"Pyroscope\"]\n        S2[\"Parca\"]\n    end\n    subgraph VIEW[\"展示层\"]\n        V1[\"Grafana\"]\n        V2[\"speedscope\"]\n        V3[\"pprof Web UI\"]\n    end\n    COLLECT --&gt; STORE\n    STORE --&gt; VIEW</pre><h3 id=\"自动化集成到-ci-cd\">自动化集成到 CI/CD</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 在 CI 中自动生成性能基准火焰图&#10;performance-profile:&#10;  stage: test&#10;  script:&#10;    - make build&#10;    - ./bin/app --benchmark &amp;&#10;    - sleep 5&#10;    - perf record -F 99 -p $! -g -- sleep 30&#10;    - kill %1&#10;    - perf script | stackcollapse-perf.pl | flamegraph.pl &gt; flamegraph.svg&#10;  artifacts:&#10;    paths:&#10;      - flamegraph.svg&#10;    expire_in: 30 days\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 CI 中自动生成性能基准火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">performance-profile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">make build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./bin/app --benchmark &#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sleep 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">perf record -F 99 -p $! -g -- sleep 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kill %1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">perf script | stackcollapse-perf.pl | flamegraph.pl > flamegraph.svg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  artifacts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">flamegraph.svg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    expire_in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30 days</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>火焰图是性能分析的&quot;放大镜&quot;——它将海量的采样数据转化为一张直观的图像，让性能热点无处遁形。掌握火焰图的关键：理解视觉语义（宽度=占比，平顶=热点），善用差分火焰图定位回归，结合 Off-CPU 火焰图覆盖阻塞场景。将火焰图集成到日常开发流程中（CI 基准、定期采集），建立持续的性能意识。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"火焰图解读与实战","id":"火焰图解读与实战"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰图的视觉语义","id":"火焰图的视觉语义"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰图类型","id":"火焰图类型"},{"level":3,"text":"从数据到火焰图的完整流程","id":"从数据到火焰图的完整流程"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"案例一：识别 CPU 热点","id":"案例一-识别-cpu-热点"},{"level":3,"text":"案例二：Off-CPU 火焰图定位 IO 阻塞","id":"案例二-off-cpu-火焰图定位-io-阻塞"},{"level":3,"text":"案例三：差分火焰图定位性能回归","id":"案例三-差分火焰图定位性能回归"},{"level":3,"text":"案例四：内存分配火焰图","id":"案例四-内存分配火焰图"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰图的交互式分析","id":"火焰图的交互式分析"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰图采集清单","id":"火焰图采集清单"},{"level":3,"text":"常见误读纠正","id":"常见误读纠正"},{"level":3,"text":"优化效果量化","id":"优化效果量化"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰图生成工具","id":"火焰图生成工具"},{"level":3,"text":"平台集成","id":"平台集成"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化集成到 CI/CD","id":"自动化集成到-ci-cd"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"CPU 与内存 Profiling","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling/cpu-memory-profiling"},"next":{"title":"瓶颈定位方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling/bottleneck-identification"}}